  Removing the 6 below saves about $82.88/month if your usage stays the same  [estimate]

  MCP server   playwright     9k/turn  $18.40                             claude mcp remove playwright
  MCP server   sentry         3k/turn   $7.10  last used 62d ago          claude mcp remove sentry
  MCP server   figma          6k/turn   $6.20  used 4d ago - check first  claude mcp remove figma
  client tool  NotebookEdit   1k/turn   $3.30                             claude --disallowedTools "NotebookEdit"
  skill        brand-voice   420/turn   $1.60                             set "skillOverrides": {"brand-voice": "off"} in ~/.claude/settings.json
